      "id": 17,
      "options": {
        "content": "The configured `node-fed` / site-exporter target is DOWN and no live `node_*` series identifies a head, login, or control node. Therefore this suite will not show a fake root-disk percentage.\n\nTo unlock it, publish standard node-exporter labels including `node`, `role=head|login|control`, `mountpoint`, `device`, and `fstype`. This page will then show root/home/data usage, inodes, disk latency, CPU, RAM, pressure, RAID, and failed services.",
